      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Damascus,_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Damascus was incorporated in 2004 to give the community local control over land use decisions after expanding the urban growth boundary.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
