      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Damascus%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The city of Damascus went through seven city managers in just eight years during its contentious existence as a municipality.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Damascus%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Voters chose to disincorporate Damascus in 2016, returning authority to Clackamas County in the first such reversal in Oregon in four decades.",
